                <TextValueRun styleId="730786:17" text="STORY: a warm cardboard town street at midday. The soldier (grey figure, red crest, face at a third of the frame) stands before Jesus (white robe, gold sash) on `offer`; Jesus gestures toward the far house. Close-up of the soldier's face, earnest, one hand raised: stop (`only`). Split: far across town, the servant in bed; a ribbon of gold light, the word, flies across the rooftops like a paper plane and reaches the bed, and the servant sits up (`healed`). On `faith` the gold word ribbon settles into an open hand, held up." name="brief" id="730786:20"/>
            </Text>
